## 👋 About This Repository

This repository is where I document my journey of learning **SQL** and **Database Management Systems (DBMS)**.
It contains my notes, practice queries, and solutions to SQL problems as I build a strong foundation in databases — from basics like `SELECT` statements to advanced concepts like joins, subqueries, window functions, and normalization.

> 💡 **Goal:** Learn by doing — solve real problems, understand *why* a query works, not just *how*.

---

## 📚 Topics Covered

| # | Topic | Status |
|---|-------|--------|
| 1 | SQL Basics (`SELECT`, `WHERE`, `ORDER BY`) | ⬜ Not Started |
| 2 | Filtering & Aggregation (`GROUP BY`, `HAVING`) | ⬜ Not Started |
| 3 | Joins (`INNER`, `LEFT`, `RIGHT`, `FULL`) | ⬜ Not Started |
| 4 | Subqueries & Nested Queries | ⬜ Not Started |
| 5 | Window Functions | ⬜ Not Started |
| 6 | Views, Indexes & Constraints | ⬜ Not Started |
| 7 | Stored Procedures & Triggers | ⬜ Not Started |
| 8 | Database Normalization (1NF–3NF) | ⬜ Not Started |
| 9 | ER Diagrams & Schema Design | ⬜ Not Started |
| 10 | Transactions & ACID Properties | ⬜ Not Started |

> Update the ✅ / ⬜ as you complete each topic to track your own progress!

